acp-missing-opencode = OpenCode is not on the PATH. Install the opencode binary and try again. The session was not started.
acp-missing-claude-absent = The claude-agent-acp adapter is not on the PATH and Node.js is missing. Install Node.js 22 or newer and npm install -g @agentclientprotocol/claude-agent-acp@0.109.0, or set [agents] claude_acp in your user config to a release binary. The session was not started.
acp-missing-claude-old = Node.js is { $version }. The adapter needs Node.js 22 or newer, or a binary in [agents] claude_acp. The session was not started.
acp-missing-claude-node = Node.js is { $version }, but claude-agent-acp is not on the PATH. Install it with npm install -g @agentclientprotocol/claude-agent-acp@0.109.0, or point [agents] claude_acp at a release file. The session was not started.
acp-missing-claude-unread = Could not read the Node.js version ({ $output }). The claude-agent-acp adapter is not on the PATH. The session was not started.
acp-auth = Claude Code is not signed in. Sign in with claude (subscription or Console) or set ANTHROPIC_API_KEY and try again. The session did not keep waiting. { $message }
